<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Quagmires in SFT-RL Post-Training: When High SFT Scores Mislead and What to Use Instead" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Additional Experimental Results</span></a>
