<figure id="A3.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A3.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Mistral-NeMo-12B-Instruct undergone SFT-RL with SFT examples from AceReasoner1.1-SFT dataset and RLVR via GRPO on DeepScaleR dataset. Measuring prediction accuracy with coefficient of determination (<math id="A3.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>) varying the ratio of fit-validation datapoints. Reporting Pass@1 performance averaged over 7 math benchmarks. We randomly select x SFT models and fit a linear function between their post-SFT performance and performance after RL, and use it to predict for the rest SFT models. We repeat random sampling for 100 times and report standard errors.</span></figcaption>
