<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Shortest Examples</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A sample Shortest Examples from Llama-Nemotron Post-Training Dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">Singhal et al., </a>)</cite> <span id="A4.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(<math id="A4.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math>750 tokens)</span>:</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A4.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A4.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input<math id="A4.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">]</annotation></semantics></math></span>:</p>
